    <description>A Foundation rifle firing magnetically accelerated rounds. Each hit deals physical damage and releases a short EMP pulse that disrupts mechanoids and powered equipment. A direct hit can cause brain shock in a human carrying at least three implants.</description>
    <techLevel>Spacer</techLevel>
    <graphicData>
      <texPath>Things/Item/Equipment/WeaponRanged/ScpFoundationEMPRifle</texPath>
      <graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
