  <ThingDef ParentName="BaseHumanMakeableGun">
    <defName>SCP_FoundationNetLauncher</defName>
    <label>Foundation containment net launcher</label>
    <description>A short-range pneumatic launcher that bursts a weighted restraint net around its target. A single hit immobilizes a human-sized subject for roughly three hours without serious injury. Large creatures can keep moving until struck by enough nets, making the launcher useful for capture but unreliable as a general battlefield weapon.</description>
